		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elixir C</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A cleansing elixir that heals conditions.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction:</strong> When you gain a negative condition. Heal 1 negative condition (not including Wounds). If you were Dazed, regain 1 Action.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Heal all negative conditions (not including Wounds).</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Advantage on saves vs being Poisoned.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Remove all your negative conditions yourself.</em></p>",
